{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53158","headline":"紫玉见南山赋附歌 · 李觐","name":"紫玉见南山赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归大素兮远蛮屏，有瑞玉兮见霄岭。\n浮紫气於云际，混清辉於水影。\n庶南山之不骞，期我皇之惟永。\n（见《文苑英华》卷八六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李觐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}